  "body": "## Summary\n- advance intake to schema v3 with one candidate per independently mergeable run\n- merge passing noncanonical packets independently after green CI\n- require below-threshold packets to carry actionable gap metadata\n- leave failing packets on open draft PRs instead of letting them block passing siblings\n- enforce 1/1/1 across split daily run directories\n\n## Required blocked-PR explanation\nEach gap PR must state achieved versus required coverage, denominator methodology, missing evidence, attempted sources and outcomes, and exact help requested from T.\n\n## Verification\n- 31 tests passed, 1 conditional fixture skipped\n- validate-intake clean\n- validate-okf clean\n- git diff --check clean",
